@startuml US_3_1_4_C1
title US 3.1.4 - Cenário de feedback

actor User
participant SPA as "Página/form"
participant Toast as "ToastService"
participant API as "TodoApi"

User -> SPA: Executa ação (guardar, apagar)
SPA -> API: chamada REST
API --> SPA: sucesso ou erro
SPA -> Toast: success/error
SPA -> User: mensagens junto aos campos + loading indicators

@enduml
